{
"file": 1159,
"paths": [
"d009/d040/f051"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "05a8dba9",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "9622f9b0",
"en_raw": "answer the doctor properly"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "fc3b957c",
"en_raw": "I'm truly sorry..."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "57f24b4b",
"en_raw": "And yet, why is Kurumi..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "fc83fe41",
"en_raw": "What should I say"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "59bc428f",
"en_raw": "to get through to her?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6803a615",
"en_raw": "Please don't worry about it"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "5bd25a67",
"en_raw": "I don't expect Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "692f94d6",
"en_raw": "to thank me right away"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a80f9799",
"en_raw": "I'm truly sorry"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "76f55061",
"en_raw": "Well, anyway, things have"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "59f86be9",
"en_raw": "only just begun"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "80d0f372",
"en_raw": "She was very attached"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "bfe2353c",
"en_raw": "to Takehiko, but"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "a0d5dd57",
"en_raw": "I don't understand"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "b76925d4",
"en_raw": "Takehiko's methods..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c6154d33",
"en_raw": "As a human being, I respect"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "9fa48402",
"en_raw": "my senior"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "813c9858",
"en_raw": "But in his position as a doctor"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "9caecef4",
"en_raw": "it's another matter"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "3aeb7f7f",
"en_raw": "Senior has abandoned treatment"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "dc473f89",
"en_raw": "He's trying to take away"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "fbeb32de",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's future"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "34a179c8",
"en_raw": "He doesn't truly understand"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3afc75a0",
"en_raw": "the feelings of parents"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "3665a4d5",
"en_raw": "who share the same worries and pain..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "424752d4",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko~!"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "6e831e55",
"en_raw": "No!"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "36030189",
"en_raw": "Kurumi!"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "3902125d",
"en_raw": "...Ah, sorry"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "01fdcbf6",
"en_raw": "She's always like this"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2d133c51",
"en_raw": "Apologize to the doctor properly"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "176716bd",
"en_raw": "No, Kurumi didn't do anything wrong"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "de198ca6",
"en_raw": "Because Mom is a liar!"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "123c616e",
"en_raw": "Honestly, this child..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "5e52d9ae",
"en_raw": "It's all right, ma'am"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "b06df20c",
"en_raw": "She'll recover"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "06cf486f",
"en_raw": "Nice to meet you"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "19ec8942",
"en_raw": "Are you Kurumi Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c4c781d4",
"en_raw": "Huh... where's Dr. Takehiko?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "0ea6caaf",
"en_raw": "I'm Akigawa, pleased to meet you"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "24d7909b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "6564638f",
"en_raw": "came to see Dr. Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "992bfe79",
"en_raw": "...Where's Dr. Takehiko?"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "81059d9e",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "8210c62d",
"en_raw": "is my senior, but..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "48d250ff",
"en_raw": "From now on, I'll be"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "32f2f162",
"en_raw": "the one examining Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "6447ec94",
"en_raw": "So, nice to meet you, okay?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "6f491f89",
"en_raw": "It's truly heartbreaking"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "08b7deca",
"en_raw": "Better effects than expected"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a35b81e5",
"en_raw": "Also, respect your senior!"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d0730e30",
"en_raw": "I haven't done anything yet"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "8d2a291c",
"en_raw": "The real treatment is from now"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "1a67c134",
"en_raw": "...A hospital visit?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "3cf8591b",
"en_raw": "Do you still want to hear my opinion"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "ac1e0123",
"en_raw": "if you wish to talk"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "853c2353",
"en_raw": "Then I'll say it frankly"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "25c3f8c8",
"en_raw": "Akigawa"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "fafc964e",
"en_raw": "don't get too arrogant"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "0c77d86b",
"en_raw": "Doctors"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "e897db7d",
"en_raw": "aren't scientists, you know"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "bbc4082c",
"en_raw": "Medicine is benevolence, naturally"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "0bb5b41d",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "390fc8bb",
"en_raw": "did you do something bad?"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "2deb2cb0",
"en_raw": "Kurumi looks"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "e0acb586",
"en_raw": "Did you have a scary dream?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "0ed76e3b",
"en_raw": "It'll be fine"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "7df2e34e",
"en_raw": "Kurumi did nothing wrong"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "9c4a78fe",
"en_raw": "...Any effect on the treatment?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "ad02ebc8",
"en_raw": "Um, what about school?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "35dfefe9",
"en_raw": "If she rests tonight, from tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "38a3cda0",
"en_raw": "she can live without trouble"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "11d95f3a",
"en_raw": "There shouldn't be a problem"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "e549351d",
"en_raw": "Timing-wise"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "0a0bd888",
"en_raw": "we expected it to some extent..."
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "9ef18a6d",
"en_raw": "Rather, the new drug and"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "6fa43963",
"en_raw": "hormonal changes"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "5635150c",
"en_raw": "may have a synergistic"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "f92b6382",
"en_raw": "effect, which we can hope for"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "94f49c97",
"en_raw": "Thank you"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "af8a118f",
"en_raw": "However, for the time being"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "b83576c0",
"en_raw": "it may occur periodically"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "47035bf9",
"en_raw": "and then those around her shouldn't panic"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "7ad0b267",
"en_raw": "...well, Mom, please explain it well"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "e5c61d2f",
"en_raw": "and ease her anxiety"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "8aeb8373",
"en_raw": "What's wrong, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "82241e54",
"en_raw": "As I've said many times..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "3f75ba3e",
"en_raw": "Treatment with the new drug"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "867ec09e",
"en_raw": "itself can be called a success"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "30b9c321",
"en_raw": "A rejection reaction"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "b33726b3",
"en_raw": "to the sudden increase of information"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "f41887e8",
"en_raw": "Other than that"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "48b6261e",
"en_raw": "the cause can't be identified"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "003908d0",
"en_raw": "Why say such a thing now!"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "c486095b",
"en_raw": "I understand how you feel but..."
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "d91fb06d",
"en_raw": "Enough, stop, Masayo"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "bc5e634d",
"en_raw": "At present we prioritize her life"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "20a255eb",
"en_raw": "but even so"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "e99f6668",
"en_raw": "it's about fifty-fifty"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "186bc84e",
"en_raw": "Please understand"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "0c9925ab",
"en_raw": "...Was what I did"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "b6d8fcfb",
"en_raw": "wrong?"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "64604f16",
"en_raw": "Maybe"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "590ebf7d",
"en_raw": "...What terrible parents"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "7e45856a",
"en_raw": "Blaming yourself is meaningless"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "2914870c",
"en_raw": "All I can say is"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "12e79e1d",
"en_raw": "we couldn't understand Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "f7eaba55",
"en_raw": "Masayo, don't think about anything now"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "e700e0d6",
"en_raw": "When she comes back..."
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "a85330ef",
"en_raw": "this time just accept her"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "05f7f6d2",
"en_raw": "That's all there is to it"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "cfb2f8e5",
"en_raw": "Shall we begin..."
}
]
}